{%- comment -%}
  „Любими“ (2026-10-07, owner; after moonmagic.com's wishlist). The saved pieces are kept in
  this browser on this device (localStorage, key „cullinan-wishlist“; no account, no app),
  so the page is filled by assets/wishlist.js: it asks Shopify for each saved product's card
  (/products/<handle>?section_id=cj-wishlist-card, sections/cj-wishlist-card.liquid), which
  is the shop's own product card with a filled heart and „Премахни“. With nothing saved, or
  without scripts, the empty message and a button to the catalogue show instead.
  Reached at /collections/all?view=wishlist (templates/collection.wishlist.json), so no page
  has to be created in Shopify admin; the header's heart links there.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'template-collection.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'component-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'component-swatch.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'component-price.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'card-swatches.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

<div class="cj-wishlist page-width is-loading" data-cj-wishlist>
  <h1 class="cj-wishlist__title">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Любими' | escape }}</h1>
  <p class="cj-wishlist__note">Любимите ви се пазят в този браузър на това устройство.</p>

  {%- comment -%} .collection: the catalogue's own card rules (title, price, swatches) are scoped to it. {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="collection">
    <ul
      class="cj-wishlist__grid grid product-grid grid--2-col-tablet-down grid--3-col-desktop"
      role="list"
      data-cj-wishlist-grid
    ></ul>
  </div>

  <div class="cj-wishlist__empty" data-cj-wishlist-empty hidden>
    <p class="cj-wishlist__empty-text">Все още нямате любими бижута.</p>
    <a class="button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Разгледайте бижутата</a>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <div class="cj-wishlist__empty">
      <p class="cj-wishlist__empty-text">Все още нямате любими бижута.</p>
      <a class="button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Разгледайте бижутата</a>
    </div>
  </noscript>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Любими",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Любими"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
